 has $30$ apples, how many peaches does he have?" 13194139533811 true] [17592186252907 1113 #uuid "a2ac6a51-e2c1-5822-97ee-00799ffc99ed" 13194139533811 true] [17592186252907 1145 "We start with the ratio $6:7$ and write it as a fraction:\n\n$$\n\\frac{6}{7}\n$$\n\nIn this fraction, the numerator represents the number of apples and the denominator represents the total number of fruits.\n\nWe can make a numerator of $30$ by multiplying the numerator and denominator by $5:$\n\n$$\n\\frac{6\\times 5}{7\\times 5}=\\frac{30}{35}\n$$\n\nTherefore, Jason has $35$ fruits in total. So, the number of peaches Jason has is\n\n$$\n35-30=5.\n$$" 13194139533811 true] [17592186252908 1000 #edb/ref 17592186252909 13194139533811 true] [17592186252908 1000 #edb/ref 17592186252910 13194139533811 true] [17592186252908 1000 #edb/ref 17592186252911 13194139533811 true] [17592186252908 1000 #edb/ref 17592186252912 13194139533811 true] [17592186252908 1000 #edb/ref 17592186252913 13194139533811 true] [17592186252908 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533811 true] [17592186252908 1041 "selection" 13194139533811 true] [17592186252908 1104 #edb/ref 17592186252913 13194139533811 true] [17592186252908 1110 #uuid "9df75cf1-7961-5a6f-8293-eac424a86e58" 13194139533811 true] [17592186252909 1034 "8" 13194139533811 true] [17592186252909 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533811 true] [17592186252909 1111 #uuid "884cd7c2-01af-5434-954c-2bad2b76fd53" 13194139533811 true] [17592186252910 1034 "2" 13194139533811 true] [17592186252910 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533811 true] [17592186252910 1111 #uuid "598f4e4f-addd-5654-83a4-e0da0b36e120" 13194139533811 true] [17592186252911 1034 "6" 13194139533811 true] [17592186252911 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533811 true] [17592186252911 1111 #uuid "ba8f9c3a-fb08-5c32-b5c3-461298bbd5b5" 13194139533811 true] [17592186252912 1034 "4" 13194139533811 true] [17592186252912 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533811 true] [17592186252912 1111 #uuid "